- `computeMetaHash()` - Hash meta for staleness detection (includes templates)
- `generateAgentsContent()` - Compose final markdown from data + templates
- `checkAgentStatus()` - Compare stored vs computed hashes

**Freshness Tracking:**
- Computes SHA256 hash of skills, conventions, workflows, templates
- Stores hash & timestamp in `.kspec/.kspec-agents-hash`
- Skips regeneration if content unchanged (optimization)

