## 4. Ralph Module (`src/ralph/` directory)

**6 files totaling ~60KB:**

### `index.ts` (Exports Hub)
Re-exports all ralph functionality:
- CLI renderer & event translation
- Subagent spawning & prompting
- Loop error handling
- Wrap-up agent

### `cli-renderer.ts` (~9.3KB)
- Translates ACP `SessionUpdate` events to `RalphEvent`
- Renders events to console with formatting (thoughts, actions, tool results, status)
- Supports custom prefixes for subagent output

### `events.ts` (~24KB)
Core event translation:
- Maps ACP message types → `RalphEvent` types
- Handles streaming text, tool calls, tool results
- Translates thinking/action to structured events

### `subagent.ts` (~14KB)
PR review subagent spawning:
- `runSubagent()` - Spawns agent with context, handles timeout, tracks result
- `buildSubagentPrompt()` - Constructs prompt from task, spec, git context
- `DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_TIMEOUT`: 20 minutes

### `loop-errors.ts` (~5.2KB)
Failure tracking & escalation:
- `parseFailureCount()` - Parse `[LOOP-FAIL:N]` note prefix
- `getTaskFailureCount()` - Get highest count from task notes
- `processFailedIteration()` - Track failures per task
- `shouldEscalate()` - Escalate to `automation:needs_review` at threshold (3 failures)

### `wrap-up.ts` (~12.9KB)
Exit summary agent:
- `runWrapUpAgent()` - Spawns final agent to summarize session
- `buildWrapUpContext()` - Builds context from exit reason & pending tasks
- Skips wrap-up for `dry_run` or certain exit reasons
- Uses same adapter & auto-approve args as main worker

