## 9. Template File (`templates/agents-sections/06-ralph-loop.md`)

**Content (~46 lines):**
- Explains loop flow: task work → reflection → subagent review → iterate
- Task inheritance priority: `needs_work > in_progress > pending`
- Blocking rules: genuine blockers only (architectural decisions, spec clarifications, unavailable APIs, formal dependencies)
- Auto-exit behavior: ralph exits when no tasks remain
- Manual `end-loop` escape hatch (rare)

